FIND F23 sev=M tag=bug at=flight-sim3.html#"nhud-topright" what="CREDITS chip clips at the top-right screen edge in flight; legacy score text '0x·B0/RISK' ghost renders unstyled beside it" fix="wrap credits+reward-toast+fps/ping into one nhud-panel block (ref layout) anchored right:14px top:10px inside the viewport; find the legacy score streak element still rendering (grep score-streak / risk writers) and restyle it into the block (streak as small sub-label) or hide its legacy shell" ref=- dep=-
FIND F24 sev=L tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html#"gustBase" what="ref shows WIND chip under left cluster; game HAS a gust/wind system" fix="small nhud-mini chip 'WIND <dir> <kts>' under the left cluster; derive kts from the gust amplitude value and a stable pseudo-direction (e.g. NE fixed or from wind vector if one exists — grep wind usage in physics); update at 2Hz" ref=- dep=F21
FIND F25 sev=L tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html#"nhudBuildCompass" what="compass ribbon lacks minor tick marks between labels" fix="add 5deg minor / 15deg major ticks to the prebuilt scale strip (CSS repeating-linear-gradient or generated spans)" ref=- dep=-
